        "r": 275.09399999999994,
        "b": 391.7073344167462
      },
      "content": "Use a 7mm spanner to hold the terminal on the element and loosen the M7 hex nut fixing the wiring connection. Follow the same procedure re-connecting the wiring and tighten to 2 Nm."
    },
