      "bbox": {
        "l": 363.7110000000001,
        "t": 574.2660195312501,
        "r": 549.6510000000002,
        "b": 514.6893344167463
      },
      "content": "The element is fixed using two M7 hex bolts on the X12 & three on the X16, tightened to 2.1 Nm and supported with a single M5.5 hex flange nut on the X12 & two on the X16, tightened to 1.7 Nm."
